# VHS M1: brief 4.1 rule 8.
title VHS M1 with a camera without MJPEG: the YUYV live view only (photo and record refused later)
sizes 800x480
env VHS_FORMAT rgb565
env VHS_FAKE yuyv

wait 1500
shot 01-yuyv
expect text "640x480  30 fps"
expect text "Fake YUYV Camera, YUYV. Space takes a photo, Tab switches to Video, R records."
key esc
expect quit
